/-
This module defines a Brockian circle embedding on the 5-cycle using the 5th root of unity.
It defines `ω` as the 5th root of unity, `emb` as the embedding function, and `dist` as the Euclidean distance.
It proves that the rotation `a ↦ a + 1` is an isometry with respect to this distance.
-/

import Mathlib

